            0.149
          ],
          "content": "So, $\\textstyle { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } }   ,   { \\frac { 2 } { 4 } }$ , and $\\frac{3}{6}$ are all **equivalent fractions**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.167,
            0.884,
            0.191
          ],
          "content": "Find some more fractions equivalent to $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ . Write them in the"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.213,
            0.293,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": "boxes here:"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.339,
